	quest.000000000000023E.quest_desc: ["This machine uses energy to extract dusts out of certain blocks and ores, making it essential to producing different kinds of tools. Not to be mistaken with the Crusher, this machine is the pulverizer equivalent in other mods."]
	quest.000000000000023E.quest_subtitle: "Craft an Enrichment Chamber"
	quest.0000000000000242.quest_desc: ["The Combiner allows the player to create an ore block from 8 dust. Place the ore dust in the top slot, and some cobblestone in the bottom slot, and it will combine to make the ore block."]
	quest.0000000000000242.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Combiner"
	quest.0000000000000244.quest_desc: ["The Crusher crushes, among other things, clumps into Dirty Dusts, Ingots into dusts and Biomatter into Bio Fuel."]
	quest.0000000000000244.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Crusher"
	quest.0000000000000246.quest_desc: [
		"The Metallurgic Infuser is the first step in the Mekanism tech tree."
		" "
		"It's a machine used in the production of Steel Ingots, Bronze Ingot, Enriched Alloy, and Obsidian Ingots."
	]
	quest.0000000000000246.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Metallurgic Infuser"
	quest.0000000000000248.quest_desc: ["The Purification Chamber uses oxygen to refine Ores and shards into clumps. Each ore makes 3 clumps, whereas each shard only gives one clump."]
	quest.0000000000000248.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Purification Chamber"
	quest.000000000000024A.quest_desc: ["The energized smelter is your basic electric furnace that uses energy instead of fuel to smelt items."]
	quest.000000000000024A.quest_subtitle: "Craft an Energized Smelter"
	quest.000000000000024C.quest_desc: [
		"The Rotary Condensentrator (pronounced \"con-DEN-sen-traitor\") is used for converting substances between liquid and gaseous forms at a rate of 1:1."
		" "
		"It has two modes: Decondensentrating, which turns Liquids into Gases, and Condensentrating, which turns Gases into Liquids."
	]
	quest.000000000000024C.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Rotary Condensentrator"
	quest.000000000000024E.quest_desc: ["The Chemical Oxidizer is used for making gases from materials. It's left side accepts incoming materials, while it's right side dispenses the gas created from those materials."]
	quest.000000000000024E.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Chemical Oxidizer"
	quest.0000000000000250.quest_desc: [
		"The Chemical Infuser combines or reacts two gases to create another gas."
		""
		"The gas gauges on the left and right side of its GUI are the input tanks, and correspond to correspond with the left and right sides of the machine."
		" "
		"The gauge in the middle is for the resulting gas, which likewise is output through the front of the machine."
	]
	quest.0000000000000250.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Chemical Infuser"
	quest.0000000000000254.quest_desc: ["The Electrolytic Separator sends controlled amounts of direct current into a fluid, causing the atoms in the fluid to break their bonds."]
	quest.0000000000000254.quest_subtitle: "Craft an Electrolytic Separator"
	quest.0000000000000256.quest_desc: ["The Precision Sawmill is used for reclaiming wood from wooden items and turn logs into planks with a 50% better yield (6 instead of 4). Also makes sawdust for use in making Cardboard Box."]
	quest.0000000000000256.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Precision Sawmill"
	quest.0000000000000258.quest_desc: ["The Chemical Dissolution Chamber is the first machine in the x5 ore processing setup."]
	quest.0000000000000258.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Chemical Dissolution Chamber"
	quest.000000000000025A.quest_desc: [
		"The Chemical Washer turns Slurry into Clean Slurry using Water. The clean slurry then needs to be further refined by pumping it into a Chemical Crystallizer."
		" "
		"Note that unlike most Mekanism machines this one has fixed \"in\" and \"out\" sides for the mineral flow. \"In\" will be on the left when first placed and \"out\" is on the right."
	]
	quest.000000000000025A.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Chemical Washer"
	quest.000000000000025C.quest_desc: [
		"The Chemical Crystallizer turns Clean Slurry into Crystals and lithium into lithium dust."
		""
		"This is one of the select many machines in Mekanism to have dedicated, unchangeable sides for input and output."
	]
	quest.000000000000025C.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Chemical Crystalliser"
	quest.000000000000025E.quest_desc: [
		"The Pressurized Reaction Chamber (PRC) is used primarily to create Substrate (to create HDPE Pellets), HDPE Pellets (to create HDPE Sheets), and Ethylene (an efficient source of fuel used in the Gas-Burning Generator)."
		" "
		"It has a variable speed and energy usage dependent on the materials/gasses it is creating."
	]
	quest.000000000000025E.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Pressurized Reaction Chamber"
	quest.0000000000000264.quest_desc: ["Achieved by enriching Obsidian in the Enrichment Chamber."]
	quest.0000000000000264.quest_subtitle: "Obtain some Obsidian Dust"
	quest.0000000000000266.quest_desc: ["Crafted by infusing Obsidian Dust with Diamond Dust or Compressed Diamond in the Metallurgic Infuser."]
	quest.0000000000000266.quest_subtitle: "Craft Refined Obsidian Dust"
	quest.0000000000000268.quest_desc: [
		"The Osmium Compressor is used to create Refined Obsidian Ingots from Refined Obsidian Dust and Glowstone Ingots from Glowstone Dust."
		""
		"It fuses liquid Osmium (melted down Osmium Ingots placed in the machine's bottom slot) with the originating materials to create their corresponding ingots."
	]
	quest.0000000000000268.quest_subtitle: "Create an Osmium Compressor"
	quest.000000000000026C.quest_desc: ["The Refined Obsidian Ingot is an ingot created by placing Refined Obsidian Dust into an Osmium Compressor fueled with Liquid Osmium (from Osmium Ingots)."]
	quest.000000000000026C.quest_subtitle: "Create Refined Obsidian Ingot(s)"
	quest.000000000000026E.quest_desc: ["The Digital Miner is the scale mining machine of Mekanism. However, this machine is like no other as it \"magically-teleports\" mined blocks to its inventory."]
	quest.000000000000026E.quest_subtitle: "Craft the Digital Miner"
	quest.0000000000000270.quest_desc: [
		"The Quantum Entangloporter is a machine that allows liquids/items/energy/gas to be sent from one Quantum Entangloporter to another through a channel."
		" "
		"The Quantum Entangloporter is similar to the Tesseract from earlier versions of Thermal Expansion, but the Quantum Entangloporter can send and receive gasses while the Tesseract cannot."
	]
	quest.0000000000000270.quest_subtitle: "Craft the Quantum Entangloporter"
	quest.0000000000000272.quest_desc: ["The Teleportation Core is a Crafting Component used in the crafting of the Portable Teleporter, the Teleporter and the Digital Miner."]
	quest.0000000000000272.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Teleportation Core"
	quest.0000000000000274.quest_desc: ["Robit is Mekanism's mechanical companion. He can act as a crafting grid, a furnace, an anvil, a chest, or simply a cute little buddy."]
	quest.0000000000000274.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Robit"
	quest.000000000000027A.quest_desc: [
		"The Chemical Injection Chamber uses Hydrogen Chloride gas to turn ores into 4 Shards. It is the start of x4 ore processing and requires a steady supply of Hydrogen Chloride, which in turn requires the player to have a Thermal Evaporation Plant running."
		" "
		"It can also turn Water Vapor and Dirt into Clay. Like most Mekanism machines, the Chemical Injection Chamber has a Factory block of itself."
	]
	quest.000000000000027A.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Chemical Injection Chamber"
	quest.000000000000027C.quest_desc: ["Steel Casing is a block used in the crafting recipe of most Mekanism machines."]
	quest.000000000000027C.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Steel Casing"
	quest.000000000000027E.quest_desc: ["Crafted by the Metallurgic Infuser this is the basis from which Steel Dust can be attained by reprocessing it in the Metallurgic Infuser."]
	quest.000000000000027E.quest_subtitle: "Create Enriched Iron"
	quest.0000000000000280.quest_desc: [
		"Steel Dust is produced by infusing an iron ingot with 10 units of carbon (producing Enriched Iron) and then infusing that with a further 10 units of Carbon."
		" "
		"(Carbon = Coal, Charcoal or Refined Carbon)"
	]
	quest.0000000000000280.quest_subtitle: "Craft Steel Dust"
	quest.0000000000000280.title: "Steel Dust"
	quest.0000000000000282.quest_desc: ["A Steel Ingot can be created by smelting Steel Dust in any type of furnace."]
	quest.0000000000000282.quest_subtitle: "Create Steel Ingot(s)"
	quest.0000000000000282.title: "Steel Ingot"
	quest.0000000000000284.quest_desc: ["The Chargepad is a wireless electric charging station. Any rechargeable items you have in your inventory will be charged while standing on it."]
	quest.0000000000000284.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Chargepad"
	quest.0000000000000292.quest_desc: [
		"The Teleporter Portal is a multi-block structure that allows the player to teleport between Teleporters on the same frequency."
		" "
		"Read more about it on the Wiki:"
		"https://wiki.aidancbrady.com/wiki/Teleporter_Portal"
	]
	quest.0000000000000292.quest_subtitle: "Craft the Teleporter Compontents"
	quest.0000000000000295.quest_desc: [
		"Glowstone Ingots are made by putting Glowstone in a powered Osmium Compressor with Glowstone in the top and Osmium Ingots in the bottom."
		" "
		"Glowstone Ingots can be used for making Glowstone Armor, Refined Glowstone blocks and Teleporter Frames."
	]
	quest.0000000000000295.quest_subtitle: "Create Glowstone Ingot(s)"
	quest.0000000000000299.quest_desc: [
		"Tier Installers are used to upgrade various machines into their Factory equivalent. Right-click on the machine with the Tier Installer and it will upgrade that machine"
		"- its level (Basic, Advanced, or Elite) depending on the level of the Tier Installer used."
	]
	quest.0000000000000299.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Basic Tier Installer"
	quest.000000000000029B.quest_desc: [
		"Tier Installers are used to upgrade various machines into their Factory equivalent. Right-click on the machine with the Tier Installer and it will upgrade that machine"
		"- its level (Basic, Advanced, or Elite) depending on the level of the Tier Installer used."
	]
	quest.000000000000029B.quest_subtitle: "Craft an Advanced Tier Installer"
	quest.000000000000029D.quest_desc: [
		"Tier Installers are used to upgrade various machines into their Factory equivalent. Right-click on the machine with the Tier Installer and it will upgrade that machine"
		"- its level (Basic, Advanced, or Elite) depending on the level of the Tier Installer used."
	]
	quest.000000000000029D.quest_subtitle: "Craft an Elite Tier Installer"
	quest.000000000000029F.quest_desc: [
		"Tier Installers are used to upgrade various machines into their Factory equivalent. Right-click on the machine with the Tier Installer and it will upgrade that machine"
		"- its level (Basic, Advanced, or Elite) depending on the level of the Tier Installer used."
	]
	quest.000000000000029F.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Ultimate Tier Installer"
	quest.00000000000002A3.quest_desc: [
		"Right click a 'Fluid Extractor' with a bucket when it's at 1,000mb to get a Latex Bucket."
		""
		"&7- Optional."
	]
	quest.00000000000002A3.quest_subtitle: "Acquire a Latex Bucket"
	quest.00000000000002A6.quest_desc: ["A Pity Machine Frame used in almost every IF machine."]
	quest.00000000000002A6.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Pity Machine Frame"
	quest.00000000000002AC.quest_subtitle: "Craft an Animal Rancher"
	quest.00000000000002AE.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Plant Gatherer"
	quest.00000000000002B0.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Plant Fertilizer"
	quest.00000000000002B2.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Plant Sower"
	quest.00000000000002B4.quest_subtitle: "Craft an Animal Feeder"
	quest.00000000000002B6.quest_desc: ["Can be used to produce Pink Slime \\& Liquid Meat."]
	quest.00000000000002B6.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Mob Slaughter Factory"
	quest.00000000000002B8.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Sewer"
	quest.00000000000002BA.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Sewage Composter"
	quest.00000000000002BC.quest_subtitle: "Craft an Animal Baby Separator"
	quest.00000000000002BE.quest_desc: ["Used to create Dry Rubber by pumping in Latex \\& Water into the Latex Processing Unit."]
	quest.00000000000002BE.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Latex Processing Unit"
	quest.00000000000002C0.quest_desc: ["Used to produce Latex by placing Logs infront of the Fluid Extractor."]
	quest.00000000000002C0.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Fluid Extractor"
	quest.00000000000002C2.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Dissolution Chamber"
	quest.00000000000002C4.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Block Breaker"
	quest.00000000000002C6.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Biofuel Generator"
	quest.00000000000002C8.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Bioreactor"
	quest.00000000000002CA.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Spores Recreator"
	quest.00000000000002CC.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Material StoneWork Factory"
	quest.00000000000002CE.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Sludge Refiner"
	quest.00000000000002D0.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Water Condensator"
	quest.00000000000002D2.quest_subtitle: "Craft Mechanical Dirt"
	quest.00000000000002D6.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Dye Mixer"
	quest.00000000000002D8.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Fluid Placer"
	quest.00000000000002DA.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Resourceful Furnace"
	quest.00000000000002DC.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Mob Detector"
	quest.00000000000002DE.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Marine Fisher"
	quest.00000000000002E0.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Stasis Chamber"
	quest.00000000000002E8.quest_desc: [
		"Obtained by dropping redstone between Obsidian \\& Bedrock."
		""
		"Obsidian on top and bedrock on the bottom- drop redstone between them and then left click the obsidian."
		""
		"&o*loud noises*- Flux!"
		""
		"There is no limit to the amount of Redstone Dust you can use, each time."
	]
	quest.00000000000002E8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain some Flux"
	quest.00000000000002EC.quest_desc: [
		"Inventory charging can be configured in the Wireless Charging Tab."
		" "
		"Only one controller can be connected to a network at one time."
		""
		"The controller's 'Output' refers to energy outputted from the network via Wireless Charging."
		" "
		"&lNetwork's do not require a Flux &lController to operate"
	]
	quest.00000000000002EC.quest_subtitle: "Required to activate Cross-dimensional inventory charging."
	quest.00000000000002EE.quest_desc: ["Read more about Flux Networks on their Wiki: https://github.com/SonarSonic/Flux-Networks/wiki"]
	quest.00000000000002EE.quest_subtitle: "The key crafting ingredient for Flux Networks"
	quest.00000000000002EE.title: "Flux Core"
	quest.00000000000002F0.quest_desc: [
		"Flux Storage is used to store excess energy. It will only be filled once each Flux Point has received enough energy."
		""
		"&oTransfer Limit: 20000"
		""
		"This energy can only be accessed by removing energy with a Flux Point."
		""
		"&lNetwork's do not require a Flux &lStorage to operate."
	]
	quest.00000000000002F0.quest_subtitle: "Used to Store Energy in the network"
	quest.00000000000002F4.quest_desc: ["(You can add energy from all sides simultaneously.)"]
	quest.00000000000002F4.quest_subtitle: "Used for Adding Energy to the network"
	quest.00000000000002F6.quest_desc: ["(You can remove energy from all sides simultaneously.)"]
	quest.00000000000002F6.quest_subtitle: "Used to Remove Energy from the network"
	quest.00000000000002FC.quest_desc: [
		"It can also be used to copy / paste settings between connectors."
		""
		"Shift-Right Click on a connector to copy it's settings and then Right Click on a connector you wish to paste the settings to."
		""
		"If you right click something which isn't a connector you'll bring up the Network GUI and also you'll be able to edit the settings which the Configurator will paste."
		""
		"The configurator can also be renamed here, with the name field."
	]
	quest.00000000000002FC.quest_subtitle: "Can be used to access, edit, delete networks on the go."
	quest.0000000000000302.quest_desc: [
		"Flux Storage is used to store excess energy. It will only be filled once each Flux Point has received enough energy."
		""
		"&oTransfer Limit: 120000"
		""
		"This energy can only be accessed by removing energy with a Flux Point."
		""
		"&lNetwork's do not require a Flux &lStorage to operate."
	]
	quest.0000000000000302.quest_subtitle: "Used to Store Energy in the network"
	quest.0000000000000304.quest_desc: [
		"Flux Storage is used to store excess energy. It will only be filled once each Flux Point has received enough energy."
		""
		"&oTransfer Limit: 1440000"
		""
		"This energy can only be accessed by removing energy with a Flux Point."
		""
		"&lNetwork's do not require a Flux &lStorage to operate."
	]
	quest.0000000000000304.quest_subtitle: "Used to Store Energy in the network"
	quest.0000000000000308.quest_subtitle: "Another key crafting ingredients of Flux Networks!"
	quest.0000000000000319.quest_desc: [
		"An Upgrade to the Pity Machine frame, used to create higher tiered machines."
		" "
	]
	quest.0000000000000319.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Simple Machine Frame"
	quest.000000000000031F.quest_desc: [
		"Dry Rubber is acquired by putting Latex \\& Water in a Latex Processing Unit."
		" "
		"Latex is produced by placing a Log infront of a Fluid Extractor. It'll slowly produce Latex."
	]
	quest.000000000000031F.quest_subtitle: "Craft some Dry Rubber"
	quest.0000000000000321.quest_desc: [
		"Crafted by putting Dry Rubber in a Furnace."
		" "
	]
	quest.0000000000000321.quest_subtitle: "Craft some Plastic"
	quest.0000000000000321.title: "Plastic"
	quest.0000000000000325.quest_subtitle: "Acquired by piping out Pink Slime to any Tank by using Mechanical Pipes from Mekanism or anything similar."
	quest.0000000000000327.quest_desc: [
		"Pink Slime is acquired by putting the bucket of Pink Slime into the Dissolution Chamber and then putting in 1 Glass Pane."
		""
		"&o(Click the Pink Slime to see the recipe.)"
	]
	quest.0000000000000327.quest_subtitle: "Acquire Pink Slime"
	quest.00000000000003EE.quest_desc: ["&7> This dock can be placed down and be used as a chest if a Bank is stored inside it."]
	quest.00000000000003EE.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Bank Dock"
	quest.0000000000000450.quest_desc: [
		"Powah is a tech mod that adds Various ways to generate, store, and transmit Forge Energy."
		""
		"It provides several different types of energy generators, from the classic coal generator all the way to the self-building multiblock reactor."
		""
		"All of Powah's machines are tier-based. You'll start with the appropriately named \"starter\" machines and upgrade them as you go."
		""
		"The tiers are as follows: Starter, Basic, Hardened, Blazing, Niotic, Spirited and Nitro."
	]
	quest.0000000000000450.quest_subtitle: "A pasty start!"
	quest.000000000000045A.quest_desc: [
		"Can be used to capture any Mob, useful for many things."
		""
		"The Mob Imprisonment Tool can be used as many times as you like."
		" "
	]
	quest.000000000000045A.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Mob Imprisonment Tool"
	quest.000000000000045C.quest_desc: [
