	quest.000000000000054C.quest_desc: ["Craft a Soulium Dagger with 2 Soulium Ingots \\& 2 Soulium Dust, + a Gold Sword."]
	quest.000000000000054C.quest_subtitle: "Grants additional souls from peaceful creatures."
	quest.000000000000054E.quest_subtitle: "The Engineer's Screwdriver is a common item in your toolbox, which you'll need to do precise configuration on certain pieces of machinery."
	quest.0000000000000550.quest_desc: [
		"The Coke Oven is a slow one, so I would recommend for the early game to have at least 2 or 3 Coke Ovens in order to get stocked up on Coal Coke."
		" "
		"1 Piece of Coal will produce 500mb of Creosote Oil, whilst a Log will only produce 250mb."
	]
	quest.0000000000000550.quest_subtitle: "x27 Coke Bricks are needed to form the Coke Oven. Simply place down the bricks in a 3x3x3 cube. Then right click the cube with the Engineer's Hammer."
	quest.0000000000000550.title: "Coke Oven"
	quest.0000000000000552.quest_desc: [
		"The Blast Furnace will also produce Slag as a by-product."
		" "
		"Slag can be used in a Crusher to get Sand. Or used to create Concrete \\& some other building blocks."
	]
	quest.0000000000000552.quest_subtitle: "x27 Blast Bricks are needed to form the Blast Furnace. Simply place down the bricks in a 3x3x3 cube. Then right click the cube with the Engineer's Hammer."
	quest.0000000000000552.title: "Blast Furnace"
	quest.0000000000000554.quest_desc: ["The Engineer's Hammer is the most important tool at your disposal. It'll be used to form multiblocks like the Coke Oven and Blast Furnace."]
	quest.0000000000000554.quest_subtitle: "Craft the Engineer's Hammer."
	quest.0000000000000556.quest_desc: [
		"The Industrial Hemp Seeds can be obtained by breaking Tall Grass."
		" "
		"By using x3 Industrial Hemp Fibers in a crafting table they can be converted into 1 piece of string."
		" "
		"Alternatively these seeds can be obtained by using x4 DruidCraft 'Hemp Seeds' in a crafting table or inventory crafting grid. (2x2) - The Hemp Seeds from Druidcraft are obtained by breaking Tall or Short grass."
	]
	quest.0000000000000556.quest_subtitle: "Industrial Hemp, useful for the creation of Biodiesel, the hemp fibers are also used for the creation of Tough Fabric."
	quest.0000000000000559.quest_subtitle: "Tough Fabric is used in the creation of the Improved Windmill Blade \\& Insulated Cables."
	quest.000000000000055B.quest_desc: ["&7Or by other methods from other mods."]
	quest.000000000000055B.quest_subtitle: "Steel is produced by putting Iron Ingots into the Blast Furnace. And by using Charcoal / Coal Coke as fuel."
	quest.000000000000055B.title: "Steel Ingot"
	quest.000000000000055D.quest_desc: ["A total of x8 Windmill Sails are required to max out a Windmill."]
	quest.000000000000055D.quest_subtitle: "The item Windmill Sail can be used on a Windmill by right-clicking with the item in hand on the Windmill."
	quest.000000000000055F.quest_subtitle: "Acquire a bucket of Creosote Oil"
	quest.0000000000000561.quest_subtitle: "Acquire Treated Wood Planks"
	quest.0000000000000561.title: "Treated Wood Planks"
	quest.0000000000000565.quest_subtitle: "Windmill Blades are used to create the Windmill. x8 of them are needed for each Windmill."
	quest.0000000000000567.quest_desc: [
		"The power generation can be increased by using Windmill Sails on the Windmill."
		" "
		"x8 Windmills Sails are needed for maximum power."
	]
	quest.0000000000000567.quest_subtitle: "The Windmill is able to produce a pretty decent amount of FE. The amount of FE produced depends on what altitude the Windmill is located at, and if it's raining or not."
	quest.0000000000000569.quest_subtitle: "Waterwheel Segments are used to create the Water Wheel. x4 of them are needed for each Water Wheel."
	quest.000000000000056B.quest_desc: ["The Kinetic Dynamo is required to get FE out of the Wheels."]
	quest.000000000000056B.quest_subtitle: "The Water Wheels are able to produce a good amount of FE, a max total of 3 water wheel can be put side by side."
	quest.000000000000056F.quest_subtitle: "The Engineer's Wire Cutters is a tool used to disconnect the corresponding Wire Coil. It also has its uses in different recipes."
	quest.0000000000000579.quest_desc: ["Engineer's Wire Cutters can be used to disconnect wires with a right-click."]
	quest.0000000000000579.quest_subtitle: "Wire Connectors are used to input and output Energy (FE) from Wire Coils."
	quest.0000000000000579.title: "Wire Connectors"
	quest.000000000000057D.quest_desc: ["Engineer's Wire Cutters can be used to disconnect wires with a right-click."]
	quest.000000000000057D.quest_subtitle: "The Wire Relays are used to relay (connect) Wire Coils."
	quest.0000000000000581.quest_desc: ["The Kinetic Dynamo generates more FE depending on how fast the Water Wheel / Windmill spins."]
	quest.0000000000000581.quest_subtitle: "The Kinetic Dynamo generates Energy (FE) using a Windmill, Water Wheel, or Improved Windmill."
	quest.0000000000000583.quest_desc: [
		"(TIP: Don't walk into these wires. They can be very electric.)"
		" "
		"Consider upgrading these to insulated wires to not get zapped whilst trying to walk near them."
		" "
		"(This Wire Coil can only manage up to 2048 FE/t; for any higher, a MV Wire Coil is needed.)"
	]
	quest.0000000000000583.quest_subtitle: "Wire Coils are used with Wire Connectors to power different blocks."
	quest.0000000000000585.quest_desc: [
		"(TIP: Don't try to walk into these wires. They can be very electric.)"
		" "
		"Consider upgrading these to insulated wires to not get zapped whilst trying to walk near them."
		" "
		"(This Wire Coil can only manage up to 8192 FE/t; for any higher, a HV Wire Coil is needed.)"
	]
	quest.0000000000000585.quest_subtitle: "Wire Coils are used with Wire Connectors to power different blocks."
	quest.0000000000000587.quest_desc: [
		"(TIP: Don't try to walk into these wires. They can be very electric.)"
		" "
		"(This Wire Coil can manage up to 32768 FE/t.)"
	]
	quest.0000000000000587.quest_subtitle: "Wire Coils are used with Wire Connectors to power different blocks."
	quest.0000000000000589.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Copper Coil Block"
	quest.000000000000058D.quest_desc: ["Used to create the Seed Reprocessor Machine."]
	quest.000000000000058D.quest_subtitle: "Craft the Machine Frame"
	quest.000000000000058F.quest_subtitle: "Soulium dust is acquired by Mining Soulium Ore in the Nether then Smelting it in an eligible furnace."
	quest.000000000000058F.title: "Soulium Dust"
	quest.0000000000000591.quest_subtitle: "A safer version of the LV Wire Coil. This Wire Coil won't zap you if you get too close."
	quest.0000000000000593.quest_desc: ["(Highest tier of insulated cable, as there is no HV Insulated Cable.)"]
	quest.0000000000000593.quest_subtitle: "A safer version of the MV Wire Coil. This Wire Coil won't zap you if you get too close."
	quest.0000000000000595.quest_desc: ["Check it's recipe in JEI by clicking the icon in the Quest Window."]
	quest.0000000000000595.quest_subtitle: "Soulium Ingot is created by using 2 Soulium Dust + 1 "
	quest.0000000000000597.quest_subtitle: "Craft an Engineer's Workbench"
	quest.00000000000005A7.quest_subtitle: "Craft the Engineer's Blueprint (Metal Press Molds)."
	quest.00000000000005A7.title: "Any Engineer's Blueprint"
	quest.00000000000005A9.quest_subtitle: "These molds can be used in the Metal Press machine to easily produce Gears, Plates, Rods \\& Wires."
	quest.00000000000005B1.quest_subtitle: "x27 Reinforced Blast Bricks \\& 1 Hopper are needed to form the Improved Blast Furnace. Simply place down the Reinforced Blast Bricks in a 3x3x3 cube with a hopper ontop in the middle. Then right click the cube with the Engineer's Hammer."
	quest.00000000000005B1.title: "Improved Blast Furnace"
	quest.00000000000005B6.quest_desc: ["(Each preheater requires atleast 32 FE/t to function.)"]
	quest.00000000000005B6.quest_subtitle: "The Blast Furnace preheaters are used to speed up the Improved Blast Furnace using Energy (FE)."
	quest.00000000000005B6.title: "Blast Furnace Preheaters"
	quest.00000000000005B8.quest_subtitle: "Craft an External Heater"
	quest.00000000000005B8.title: "Heater"
	quest.00000000000005BA.quest_subtitle: "The LV Capacitor is a block that can store energy (FE). It can store up to 100,000 FE."
	quest.00000000000005BC.quest_subtitle: "The MV Capacitor is a block that can store energy (FE). It can store up to 1,000,000 FE."
	quest.00000000000005BE.quest_subtitle: "The HV Capacitor is a block that can store energy (FE). It can store up to 4,000,000 FE."
	quest.00000000000005C0.quest_subtitle: "The Multimeter can be used to measure how much Energy (FE) is stored in a Capacitor. Can also read redstone levels!"
	quest.00000000000005C2.quest_desc: ["The Energy (FE), transfer rate is 4000 FE/t"]
	quest.00000000000005C2.quest_subtitle: "The Charging Station is a block that can be used to charge different items that require Energy (FE) to work."
	quest.00000000000005C4.quest_desc: [
		"As an example Lava \\& Water together generates 31FE/t."
		" "
		"For a full list of suitable liquids check out the Wiki here: "
		"https://ftb.gamepedia.com/Thermoelectric_Generator"
	]
	quest.00000000000005C4.quest_subtitle: "The Thermoelectric Generator generates Energy (FE) through the difference in temperature between blocks/liquids adjacent to it."
	quest.00000000000005C6.quest_desc: [
		"For more information regarding this machine head to the Wiki, found here:"
		"https://ftb.gamepedia.com/Garden_Cloche"
	]
	quest.00000000000005C6.quest_subtitle: "The Garden Cloche is a machine used to grow crops placed in it."
	quest.00000000000005C8.quest_desc: [
		"The Alloy Kiln can be used to produce Alloys such as Invar \\& Electrum."
		" "
		"Click the progress arrow inside the Kilns GUI to see all recipes."
	]
	quest.00000000000005C8.quest_subtitle: "x8 Kiln Bricks are needed to form the Alloy Kiln. Simply place down the bricks in a 2x2 cube. Then right click the cube with the Engineer's Hammer."
	quest.00000000000005C8.title: "Alloy Kiln"
	quest.00000000000005CA.quest_desc: [
		"For more information regarding this Multiblock head over to the Wiki found here:"
		" "
		"https://ftb.gamepedia.com/Metal_Press"
	]
	quest.00000000000005CA.quest_subtitle: "The Metal Press is a 3x1x3 multi-block. It is used to create Plates, Rods \\& Gears."
	quest.00000000000005CA.title: "Metal Press Multiblock"
	quest.00000000000005D2.quest_desc: [
		"For more information regarding this Multiblock head over to the Wiki found here:"
		" "
		"https://ftb.gamepedia.com/Crusher_(Immersive_Engineering)"
	]
	quest.00000000000005D2.quest_subtitle: "The Crusher is a 3x5x3 multi-block It is used for crushing Ores into Grit (Dusts)."
	quest.00000000000005D2.title: "Crusher Multiblock"
	quest.00000000000005DE.quest_desc: [
		"A Mining Dimension, useful for those who for example want to Quarry out large areas and don't want to ruin the Overworld."
		""
		"&cNote: &7Ores spawn at all Y Levels in this Mining Dimension. So you'll find all ores at any Y level."
	]
	quest.00000000000005DE.quest_subtitle: "A Simple Overworld Mining Dimension you can mine in."
