	quest.0000000000000CDA.quest_desc: [
		"Spirit Fire is created by throwing a demon's dream fruit on the ground and lighting it with flint and steel."
		""
		"This will burn temporarily on normal blocks but is perpetual on logs, blocks of coal, or netherrack."
		"{image:occultism:textures/gui/book/spiritfire_instructions.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
	]
	quest.0000000000000CDA.quest_subtitle: "Unleash your inner firestarter"
	quest.0000000000000CDA.title: "Look Ma, it doesn't burn!"
	quest.0000000000000CDE.quest_subtitle: "Annihilate a Shulker"
	quest.0000000000000CDE.title: "Levitation? No more!"
	quest.0000000000000CF7.quest_desc: [
		"The Foliot Crusher Spirit will be your first spirit you can summon.  "
		""
		"This spirit will be good in a pinch if you haven't made any other means to crush ores."
		""
		"However, if you progress, the more powerful crushing spirits produce more outputs and can be worth it."
	]
	quest.0000000000000CF7.quest_subtitle: "Let me tell you about my best friend"
	quest.0000000000000CF7.title: "Crush Away"
	quest.0000000000000D92.quest_desc: [
		"In order to make the candles you will need for your rituals you will need tallow obtained from killing animals."
		""
		"Using the butchers knife you can slaughter animals and get tallow for making the candles."
		""
		"Note: You will need quite a bit of tallow for all the candles but you can use other candles if those are easier to make."
	]
	quest.0000000000000D92.quest_subtitle: "Oh the horror..."
	quest.0000000000000D92.title: "Slaughter factory"
	quest.0000000000000D96.quest_desc: [
		"Purified Ink is made by throwing black dye into the spirit fire"
		""
		"Purified ink is required for every Books of Binding used in occultism but thankfully your quest gods have given you some to get you started."
	]
	quest.0000000000000D96.title: "Cleanse your Ink"
	quest.0000000000000D98.quest_desc: [
		"Chalk is a required tool for drawing runes necessary in the coming ritual pentacles."
		""
		"The first chalk you craft is the white chalk and will need to be thrown into the demon fire to make it usable."
	]
	quest.0000000000000D9A.quest_desc: ["Ahh, isn't that better, nice and clean chalk and now it can be used to draw your rituals."]
	quest.0000000000000D9A.title: "White Chalk"
	quest.0000000000000D9C.quest_desc: [
		"Golden Chalk is the next tier of chalk that is used for slightly more advanced rituals.  "
		""
		"This requires some gold and glowstone but did you know you can get glowstone without going to the nether by macerating glow lichen or glow berries? Started Botania already, you can get it from botania easily as well; check JEI for all the options."
	]
	quest.0000000000000D9C.quest_subtitle: "Oooooooh Shiney!!"
	quest.0000000000000D9C.title: "Golden Chalk"
	quest.0000000000000D9E.quest_desc: ["Purple Chalk is another chalk color in the occultist's arsenal. It allows you to bind more powerful spirits such as the Djinni."]
	quest.0000000000000D9E.quest_subtitle: "Start Drawing Purple For Me Now!!!"
	quest.0000000000000DA0.quest_desc: [
		"The last and final chalk you will make is red chalk, used in the most advanced recipes that will be used in advanced rituals such as calling the Marid."
		""
		"If you haven't been to the nether or found any blazes, there are clever ways to get blaze powder."
		"You can find magma blocks all over the overworld and oceans which macerate down to magma cream which macerate down to blaze powder."
		""
		"What, you don't have a macerator yet?  Get one, super useful!"
	]
	quest.0000000000000DA4.quest_desc: [
		"The Dimensional Storage Actuator is your gateway in to storing items in the Otherworld!"
		""
		"It starts off rather small, but your storage can be expanded by adding up to 6 Stabilizers(one on each side) pointing at the actuator."
	]
	quest.0000000000000DA8.quest_desc: [
		"Dimensional Storage Stabilizers stabilize your actuator's connection with the Otherworld."
		""
		"The more stable your connection is, the more you are able to store!"
		""
		"Up to 6 stabilizers can be added to any one Actuator. Each Tier will increase the stability allowing you to store more and more items in the Otherworld."
		""
		"They need to be placed facing the Matrix portion of your actuator and can be up to 5 blocks away. One stabilizer can be placed in each direction, the cardinal directions as well as above and below the actuator."
		"{image:occultism:textures/gui/book/storage_stabilizer.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
	]
	quest.0000000000000DAA.quest_desc: ["We need MOAR!"]
	quest.0000000000000DAC.quest_desc: ["I said MOAR!!"]
	quest.0000000000000DAE.quest_desc: [
		"I'm givin 'er all she's got Cap'n!"
		""
		"Imagine 6 of these bad boys holding the world's loot!"
	]
	quest.0000000000000DB2.quest_desc: ["The Storage Accessor is a tablet used to access your storage remotely from any distance AND across all dimensions!!!"]
	quest.0000000000000DBA.quest_desc: [
		"The Stable Wormhole is a placeable object allowing you to both access your storage in any dimension as well as pipe things in and out of your storage."
		""
		"The wormhole has pretty powerful implications when used with other storage mods such as Refined Storage or AE2.  "
		""
		"A very common setup is to use an external storage bus on the stable wormhole and now you have a REALLY big storage capacity."
	]
	quest.0000000000000DBC.quest_desc: [
		"The Soul Gem allows you to pick up any but the most powerful mobs in the world."
		""
		"Very useful for hauling sacrifices to your rituals!"
		""
		"Put the Soul Gem in your hand and right click any mob with it, the mob will be stored in the soul gem to be placed back in the world at any time with another right click!"
	]
	quest.0000000000000DBC.quest_subtitle: "Is That a Mob in Your Pocket, or Are You Just Happy to See Me?"
	quest.0000000000000DBC.title: "Soul Gem"
	quest.0000000000000DBE.quest_desc: [
		"Otherworld Goggles let's you see otherworldly materials by providing a permanent \"Third Eye\" effect without having to eat Demon's Dream Fruit."
		""
		"NOTE: The goggles are the only way to see and subsequently mine iesnium ore in the nether."
		""
		"The goggles also fit in a curio slot so you can keep them equipped at all times."
	]
	quest.0000000000000DBE.quest_subtitle: "I Wear My Otherworld Goggles at Night"
	quest.0000000000000DC2.quest_desc: ["The Iesnium Pickaxe has the same stats as a normal diamond pickaxe with the added bonus that it is able to mine Iesnium Ore."]
	quest.0000000000000DC4.quest_desc: [
		"Haven't been to the end yet?  One way to get end stone is by summoning an endermite."
		""
		"The ritual will call forth an endermite and will guaranteed drop 1-2 end stone when killed.  "
		""
		"Now you can make your purple chalk."
	]
	quest.0000000000000DC6.quest_desc: ["Need skulls for your rituals?  This will give you guaranteed skull drops"]
	quest.0000000000000DCA.quest_desc: [
		"The Dimensional Mineshaft opens a portal to an uninhabited dimension that is full of all kinds of ores just waiting to be mined."
		""
		"The only problem is, the portal is too small for a normal human to fit."
		""
		"This is not a problem for spirits however, you will need to summon one of the mining spirits to acquire the ores for you."
	]
	quest.0000000000000DCC.quest_desc: [
		"The Foliot Mining Spirit is placed into the dimensional mineshaft and returns ores and various stone blocks."
		""
		"However, being a weaker spirit, it is slow and runs out of energy fairly quickly."
	]
	quest.0000000000000DCE.quest_desc: [
		"The Djinni Mining Spirit is much stronger than its Foliot counterpart. It takes much less time for this stronger spirit to travel to and from the mining dimension, and it can bring back more ores each trip!"
		""
		"The durability of this miner has been boosted in this pack, you will not see this change until the miner loses its first point of durability in the mineshaft."
	]
	quest.0000000000000DD0.quest_desc: [
		"Normally, Otherworldly ores such are Iesnium can only be mined with tools made from otherworldly materials. "
		""
		"The occultist, however, has the ability to infuse a pickaxe with a spirit to allow them to mine these ores. The infusion process severely weakens the tool, reducing its durability greatly."
	]
	quest.0000000000000DD2.quest_desc: ["Spirit Attuned Crystals are used in a few ritual patterns and item used in ritual recipes. "]
	quest.0000000000000DD6.quest_desc: [
		"Sacrificial Bowls will be used in your rituals to place your items to perform the rituals. "
		""
		"They can be anywhere with 8 blocks away from the center golden bowl."
	]
	quest.0000000000000DD8.quest_desc: [
		"The golden sacrificial bowl goes in the center of each ritual.  "
		""
		"You will need one per ritual."
	]
	quest.0000000000000DDA.quest_desc: ["Made a mistake with your chalk?  You can break the chalk but it takes a long time to break so right clicking with a brush removes it instantly."]
	quest.0000000000000DDA.quest_subtitle: "Mistakes happen"
	quest.0000000000000DDA.title: "Brush away the bad"
	quest.0000000000000DE0.quest_desc: [
		"In order to summon more powerful spirits, you will need Afrit Essence."
		""
		"This essence can only be acquired by summoning an Unbound Afrit Spirit to this mortal plane, and defeating it."
		""
		"This, however, is no easy task as the Afrit is strong and will summon multiple minions to fight along side it."
		""
		"Defeat the Afrit to claim its essence."
	]
	quest.0000000000000DE4.quest_desc: [
		"Wither Skulls can be a chore to get sometimes."
		""
		"For those who do not wish to brave the hellish world that is the Nether, we have The Wild Hunt Ritual."
		""
		"The Wild Hunt Ritual will summon multiple possessed Wither Skeletons as well as their Possessed Skeleton minions. Each Possessed Wither Skeleton is guaranteed to drop at least one Wither Skeleton Skull."
		""
		"These Wither Skeletons also have a chance of dropping some extra loot!!!"
	]
	quest.0000000000000DE4.title: "Summon The Wild Hunt"
	quest.0000000000000DE6.quest_desc: [
		"Iesnium is an otherworldly ore found in the Nether. Using your Divination Rod should allow you to find it fairly quickly."
		""
		"Otherworld Goggles or Demon's Dream Fruit might help you see the material, but you do not need the Third Eye effect to mine it. Though you will need either an Infused Pickaxe or an Iesnium Pickaxe."
	]
	quest.0000000000000DE6.quest_subtitle: "Divination 2: Occultic Boogaloo"
	quest.0000000000000E00.quest_desc: [
		"Tired of eating Demon's Dream Fruit?  Haven't made otherworldly goggles yet?  Do I have a deal for you!"
		""
		"Summon the Otherworld Sapling Trader and he'll convert your unstable saplings into stable versions so you can see and harvest the trees normally."
	]
	quest.0000000000000E04.quest_desc: [
		"The Foliot Lumberjack spirit can harvest those pesky trees that keep growing regularly."
		""
		"The range of the Lumberjack spirit can go as high as 64x64"
	]
	quest.0000000000000E0A.quest_desc: [
		"The Foliot Transporter is yet another familiar you can summon and take along on your adventures."
		""
		"The Foliot Transporter can transfer items one stack at a time between two inventories. "
	]
	quest.0000000000000E0A.title: "Summon Foliot Transporting Spirit"
