	quest.1408688CC949B921.quest_desc: [
		"&eYou may notice that you can no longer use Templates or Blueprint Paper to make tool parts out of most materials other than Wool, Leaves, Wood, Stone and Flint.&r"
		""
		"This is not a mistake, this modpack has Silent Gear Metalworks installed. This means you need a Foundry to make tools out of those materials. "
		""
		"Search &a@sgear&r in EMI and it will show you the casts."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"You may notice that to make some of these casts, you need a tool part that is not obtainable without the cast. Do not worry! You can make these parts out of flint or bone blocks using Blueprints or Templates."
	]
