	quest.319B4C94E3D3358C.quest_desc: [
		"The Laser Matrix System is the only way for the Fusion Reactor to start. It requires millions of RF to run, so make sure you have ample power to run these lasers."
		""
		"The Laser Amplifier takes in lasers and stores the energy. You can use a redstone signal to tell it to output the energy. This one should be directed at the reactor's laser focus matrix."
		""
		"The Tractor Beam takes in lasers and outputs them in a different direction. This is a way to add more lasers to your system to store more power faster. They can, also, be used to mine blocks. "
		""
		"The laser is, well, the laser. The laser will mine blocks, so make sure to know where it's pointing. "
	]
	quest.319B4C94E3D3358C.quest_subtitle: "Build a Laser Matrix System"
