	quest.3DC6CA0155D1A333.quest_desc: [
		"The Divination Rod can be used to locate the otherworld wood and otherstone but just throwing the items into the demon fire is a much more efficient solution."
		""
		"HOWEVER, there is only one way to get Iesnium ore is to use the Divination Rod in the nether."
		""
		"To use the rod, first hold right click on the block you want to search:"
		"Oak log -> otherworld logs"
		"Andesite -> otherstone"
		"Netherrack -> Iesnium Ore"
		""
		"After the rod has been attuned, hold right click like you would drawing a bow, until the animation stops, the sound stops, and have a look around.  There will be block(s) highlighted in a white outline if there are any in the vacinity."
		""
		"If you are hunting for Iesnium, you will need a special pickaxe in order to mine it.  That's right, outlined in a future quest coming up."
	]
