	quest.4FD50CE8C099EC22.quest_desc: [
		"&f> Unlimited &aEnergy &fjust for you."
		""
		"&7All the &dUltimate Energy Cubes&7 in the recipe needs to have max amount of energy stored."
		""
		"[&e!&f] Meaning they need to have &a102.40M &fof &aFE &fstored inside of them for it to count in the recipe."
		""
		"&7[&c!&7] NOTE: After crafting any &5Ultimate Energy Cube&7, do &cNOT&7 place it down. "
		""
		"&7If you do this it will give the &5Energy Cube &aNBT data&7, which means it can't be used in the recipe."
		""
		"Charge your newly crafted (not placed) &5Ultimate Energy Cube &finside something that can charge it. Like another &aEnergy Cube&f. "
		""
		"&7Charge it to max. Take it. Don't place it down. Use it in recipe."
	]
