	quest.4FF47CEDE62BC2D6.quest_desc: [
		"> Do you want a little bit more of a challenge? Then equip Ring of the Seven Curses! Read about it below:"
		""
		"&dSeven curses will befall whoever bears it:"
		"&5- You receive double damage from &6ANY&5 source."
		"&5- Neutral creatures are aggressive towards you. (Enderman, Wolfs etc.)"
		"&5- Armor is &660%&5 less effective."
		"&5- Monsters receive &650%&5 less damage from you."
		"&5- When on fire, you burn forever."
		"&5- Every death tears your soul apart."
		"&5- You suffer from incurable insomnia."
		""
		"&dSeven blessings will reward those who withstand:"
		"&5- &6+1&d Looting Level"
		"&5- &6+1 &dFortune Level"
		"&5- &6+300%&5 &dExperience&5 dropped."
		"&5- &6+10 &dEnchanting Power&5 in &6Enchanting Table."
		"&5- Functionality of &6Ring of Ender."
		""
		"&7..Once equipped, Ring of the Seven Curses cannot be removed.. right..?"
	]
	quest.4FF47CEDE62BC2D6.quest_subtitle: "Claim your Amulet \\& Ring of the Seven Curses."
