		"Growing your Demon's Dream Seeds will give you Demon's Dream Fruit which has a decent chance to provide a short-term effect called \"The Third Eye\" This effect will allow you to see and interact with some of the otherworldly materials that Occultism offers."
		""
		"You can find some of these materials in underground groves that look like common andesite and oak logs but with \"The Third Eye\" effect, they are revealed.  "
		""
		"However we will explore easier and more sustainable ways to get base materials needed to progress."
	]
