	quest.5F70DD426F027434.quest_desc: [
		"The Fusion Reactor is a complicated structure. In simple terms it requires at least 1, or 2, inputs for fuel, and 1 out for power. You may, also, add an output for heat that you can use elsewhere. "
		""
		"It requires a laser matrix for the lasers to start the reaction. Aside from the casings, it, also, requires the controller on the top."
	]
