	quest.61D2B0514B4AEACB.quest_desc: [
		"- Infinite energy. The Omni Grid cannot run out of energy and it can dispense infinite energy for whatever reason. Whether its to charge items in your inventory or send it to nearby blocks."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"- Infinite digital furnace fuel. The Omni Grid has an upgrade that adds a Digital Furnace, which auto takes and smelts stuff in your storage at the cost of fuel. To get fuel, you have to configure it to take burnable items from your storage for it to use. Creative Core keeps fuel full so you dont need to supply it with anything."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"- Counts as infinite cobble and infinite water utility cores, which simply add infinite cobble and water to storage at the cost of energy, but with creative the FE cost is negated. Not a big deal as plenty of other mods grant those."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"- Counts as durable utility core which just makes it indestructible. Also common in other mods."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"- Counts as all 5 \"Curio Cores\". Curio cores grant a small stat boost depending on the number of cores installed, but you can only install one at a time. Creative counts as all 5"
	]
	quest.61D2B0514B4AEACB.quest_subtitle: "Craft the &eOmni Creative Core"
	quest.61D2B0514B4AEACB.title: "&6Omni Creative Core"
