	quest.638357E67F88C5D5.quest_desc: [
		"        Welcome to TNP Limitless 8!&r"
		" "
		"&e[&f!&e] &fCommands like &e/sethome&f, &e/home&f, &e/back&f, &e/warp&f etc are &cdisabled&r by &6default&r when &ccheats&r are &cdisabled&r or by &enot&r a being &6server operator&r."
		"&7&o(The intended way to play)."
		""
		"Do you want them on for your playthrough? Enable &ccheats&r or &7/op&r yourself &7&o(if on a server)&r then type:"
		"&e/ftbranks add YourNameHere casual"
		""
		"&e[&f!&e]&7 (Note: &cCheats&7 can be enabled temporarily by opening the world to &eLAN&7 then enabling &ecommands&7.)"
		""
		"&f(To then disable &ccheats&f you click the \"world globe\" to the left in the &epause menu&f then disable &ccheats&f top middle right, or.. you can &ere-enter&f the &eworld&f)."
		""
		"&e[&f!&e]&7 (Tab completion for commands won't work until you relog, reload world, change dimension or.. unalive in-game.)"
		""
		"&e[&f!&e] &fQuests usually have &eLoot Bundles&f, &eexperience levels&f \\& &eother items&f as &erewards."
		" "
		"The &eLoot Bundle loot&f can vary a lot, maybe you'll end up getting something &ereally nice,&f &oooor&r, something &eless valuable."
		" "
		"&oThe randomness will decide your fate on this one. Good luck.&r"
		" "
		"&e[&f!&e] Note: If some quests don't make sense, it's possible that the mod has changed and the quest(s) needs updating."
		""
		"&7- Gbergz, TNP Team."
	]
	quest.638357E67F88C5D5.quest_subtitle: "&7Quickly, claim your starter kit!"
