		"&e[!]&7 XP Vacuum slurps any XP orbs that is in it's vicinity and converts it to XP Juice."
		""
		"&7Range can be configured."
		""
		"&7Pump the juice into a Fluid Tank to craft Bottle o' Enchanting with some glass bottles."
	]
	quest.7EF20484F8F15AB5.quest_subtitle: "Craft an XP Vacuum"
	quest.7F085BE26F6F271E.quest_desc: [
		"&7New feature: Material used to make armor trims will get you bonus effects."
		""
		"&lEffects:"
		"- &9Lapis Lazuli:&7 Increases XP from killing mobs or mining blocks by 10%."
		"- &6Copper Ingot&r: Adds 10% swimming speed."
		"- &cRedstone:&7 Adds 10% walking speed and increases step height by 1, full set is equivalent to Speed 2 potion."
		"- &eGold Ingot&r: Makes piglins neutral."
		"- &bDiamond&7: Adds 2 armor points and 2 armor toughness."
		"- &aEmerald&r: Boosts villager reputation by 10% per piece, has no effect if reputation is negative."
		"- &5Amethyst&7: Adds 25% night vision, full set is equivalent to night vision effect "
		"- &rNether Quartz: Adds one point of thorn damage, requires direct melee contact, but does not damage armor."
		"- &8Netherite Ingot&7: Makes item fire proof, reduces fire damage by 25%, and boosts armor and armor toughness by 2 points, full set is equivalent to fire resistance potion."
	]
	quest.7F085BE26F6F271E.quest_subtitle: "Craft a trimmed armor at a Smithing Table"
	quest.7F282C5493C506C8.quest_subtitle: "Craft Energetic Alloy Seeds"
	quest.7F49873596707DA5.quest_desc: [
		"&e[!]&7 Can be used to store upto 4,000,000 FE."
		""
		"&7This can act like a multiblock, connect multiple together to store even more FE."
	]
